<title>USA: Telephonetics acquires NITROS.</title>
<headline>Telephonetics acquires NITROS.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telephonetics International Inc said it had acquired controlling interest in NITROS Franchise Corp.</p>
<p>The company did not elaborate in its statement and its officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Telephonetics provides and distributed customized digital-audio content for the telephone, among other things.</p>
</text>
